      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Petersburg is home to the Logan Fontenelle historical marker, the annual Nebraska State Antique Tractor & Horse Plowing Bee, and the Rae Valley Old Threshers Reunion.",
